// Version and build for builds started from Xcode (Product › Run / Archive). The Lightly scheme's pre-action
// (Tools/write_version_xcconfig.sh) writes the git-derived values into the git-ignored file below before every
// build, so an archive made in Xcode carries the same version and build number as the scripted builds
// (scripts/version.sh) instead of the project's placeholder 0. Scripts that pass MARKETING_VERSION and
// CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION on the command line still win. Optional include: without the file the placeholders apply.
#include? "Version.generated.xcconfig"
